sequenceDiagram
    %% write_diagram on a .mmd view: application/index.ts, project-state.ts, host-bridge.ts
    actor agent as Coding agent
    participant app as MCP server (application layer)
    participant files as Archer folder
    participant svc as Background service
    participant page as Archer page
    actor person as Person
    agent->>app: read_diagram viewId
    app->>files: read source and compile
    app-->>agent: source, sourceRevision, model
    agent->>app: write_diagram viewId, source, expectedRevision, summary
    app->>files: re-read, compare sourceRevision
    alt the file moved on since the read
        app-->>agent: revision_conflict, nothing written
    else revision matches
        app-)svc: attach, recordWrite viewId and summary (only if a service is running)
        app->>files: writeConfined: temp file, fsync, rename
        app->>app: compile the new source
        app-->>agent: status compiled or failed, with diagnostics
    end
    files-)svc: fs.watch event
    svc->>svc: after 60 ms quiet, reload and recompile the changed view
    Note over svc: within 5 s of recordWrite the change is the agent's
    svc-)page: SSE change and compile, plus presentation with the new envelope if the agent presented it
    opt the reader picked this tab themselves
        page->>svc: GET api/diagrams/id when the streamed revision differs (an older service: every second)
    end
    page->>page: project, lay out with ELK in a worker, redraw keeping the viewport
    page-->>person: change notice naming the agent and its summary
    opt the new source does not compile
        page-->>person: compile notice, last good drawing kept
    end
